1. `/workflow:solution-doc path/to/prd.md` - technical solution doc, reviewed before coding starts.
2. Create your branch, then `/workflow:start TICKET short description` - checks state, suggests a branch name, plans.
3. `/workflow:commit` - checks run first, then a commit in the format above.
4. `/workflow:pr` - checks, self-review, push, PR.

